# playpick: mode=raid boss=cold spec=warrior:protection style=good size=25
# difficulty=heroic view=844x390,touch save=fresh
#
# The Long Cold at 25-heroic is README's own hardest single cell, and
# direction.md's #1 ("doing nothing wins") has read it under a healer
# (restoration shaman, good vs idle, 2026-09-25), a ranged dps (frost mage,
# dodge, 2026-09-28) and a melee dps (warrior:arms, flee/dodge, but only at
# 10-normal, its easiest setting) -- never a tank, and never a protection
# warrior on this boss at all. The earlier protection-warrior idle/good pair
# in #1 was on The Bonegrinder at 10-normal, a different boss and difficulty,
# so this closes the last open role x difficulty gap on the hardest cell in
# the game. Fresh save, so 25-heroic is not unlocked by the chain -- the
# invite hash gets there directly, same as every prior Long Cold session.
open #b=cold&s=25&h=1
targets
ui
tap class:warrior:protection
tap pull
waitscreen fight 15
state
shot good-open

play good 200
bill
says
state
shot good-end

# Second pull, same seed (fresh profile carries nothing between `open` calls,
# so a fresh open starts the encounter's pull count back at one) -- this time
# idle, for the same #1 discrimination the healer pair used: same boss, same
# difficulty, same spec, only the style differs.
open #b=cold&s=25&h=1
targets
tap class:warrior:protection
tap pull
waitscreen fight 15
state
shot idle-open

play idle 200
bill
says
state
shot idle-end
